Changes: selects the dtellz-dark theme, adds a layout preview, and records
its upstream origin. The window structure uses Herdr's installed mods.

The color theme was inspired by the appearance of Rex and customized with
pure white primary text and vivid terminal colors. No Rex code, icons,
fonts, or other application assets are included.
